---
layout: base.njk
navKey: artists
title: Artists & Collective
metaTitle: "Artists & Collective | Phi Gallery, Watertown NY"
description: "Meet the coordinators, exhibiting artists, and musicians of Phi Gallery — the artist-run collective behind Watertown's DIY art space."
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Home
    url: /
  - label: Artists
---
<section class="section wrap">
  <header class="stack" style="margin-bottom: var(--sp-5);">
    <p class="kicker">The people</p>
    <h1 class="display" style="font-size: var(--fs-3xl);">Artists &amp; Collective</h1>
    <p class="lede">Phi Gallery is artist-run. Meet the coordinators who keep the lights on and the artists showing work on our walls and stages.</p>
  </header>

  {%- if collections.artistsCoordinators.length %}
  <div class="section-head"><h2>Coordinators</h2></div>
  <div class="grid grid--artists">
    {%- for a in collections.artistsCoordinators %}{% set card = a %}{% set cardPhoto = "" %}{% set cardPhotoAlt = "" %}{% set cardRole = "" %}{% include "partials/artist-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}

  {%- if collections.artistsOthers.length %}
  <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: var(--sp-6);"><h2>Exhibiting artists</h2></div>
  <div class="grid grid--artists">
    {%- for a in collections.artistsOthers %}{% set card = a %}{% set cardPhoto = a.data.exhibitPhoto %}{% set cardPhotoAlt = a.data.exhibitPhotoAlt %}{% set cardRole = ("exhibitor" if a.data.alsoExhibiting else "") %}{% include "partials/artist-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}

  {%- if not collections.artistsSorted.length %}
  <p class="empty-state">Artist profiles are on the way.</p>
  {%- endif %}
</section>
